### PharmaGuard Enterprise API Test Suite
### Executable via VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

@base = http://localhost:3000

# ─── 1. Staff Authentication ─────────────────────────────────
# @name loginOfficer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@pharmachain.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

# ─── 2. Ingest Compliant Telemetry Packet ─────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/reading
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temp": 4.2,
  "door": false,
  "mains": true,
  "battery": 98,
  "uptime": 120
}

###

