###

# ─── 7. Poll Active Operational Telemetry & Health ───────────
GET {{base}}/api/status

###

# ─── 8. Query Chronological Telemetry Buffer ──────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/readings

###

# ─── 9. Validate Cryptographic SHA-256 Ledger ─────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/verify

###

# ─── 10. Simulate Block Falsification (Tamper Test) ──────────
POST {{base}}/api/tamper/3

###

# ─── 11. Recompute & Repair Cryptographic Chain ───────────────
POST {{base}}/api/chain/reset

###

# ─── 12. Update Spoilage Clock Allocation Budget ─────────────
POST {{base}}/api/spoilage/budget
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seconds": 1800
}

###

# ─── 13. Re-initialize Spoilage Clock for Fresh Batch ─────────
POST {{base}}/api/spoilage/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchName": "Covaxin mRNA-1273 / Batch #CVX-9043",
  "budgetSec": 1800
}

###

# ─── 14. Generate Official Regulatory Compliance PDF ──────────
GET {{base}}/api/report.pdf

